description: 'Implement safe/unsafe boundary enforcement for raw pointers per spec
  from 2-11 (blocked on 2-11). Expected shape: typer rejects Ptr deref/arithmetic/cast
  outside an unsafe context (surface per spec — possibly `trust` block for Jinn idiom);
  FFI bindings (src/bind.rs) are the sanctioned creation site; diagnostics name the
  operation and point at the spec. Definition of done: negative compile tests for
  each forbidden op, positive tests inside the sanctioned context, escape/Perceus
  interaction tested (no double-free or leak when Ptr crosses the boundary).'
